              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ng'olunaku lutuuse, buli kifo awaabanga emizabbibu, ng'olukumi lubalibwamu kilo kkumi n'emu n'ekitundu, kiriba kisigaddemu myeramannyo n'amaggwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.23",
